# Credit is Power — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development (never commit secrets).
# In Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# REQUIRED FOR LIVE BOOKING EMBED:
# Paste your public Calendly (or Cal.com) scheduling link.
# Example: https://calendly.com/your-org/free-consultation
# If unset, /book shows an email fallback to hello@creditispower.com.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CALENDLY_URL=

# Optional notes (not env vars — configure in product / DNS):
# - Verify MX/SPF for creditispower.com and create inboxes:
#   hello@, privacy@, legal@, compliance@creditispower.com
# - Publish a physical mailing address on legal pages only after
#   the registered entity address is confirmed (do not invent one).
